      "source": "# 简支梁受均布载荷 q — 弯矩与挠曲线\n# M(x) = qx(L-x)/2，弯矩图为抛物线，跨中弯矩 M_max = qL²/8\n# 挠曲线: w(x) = qx(L-x)(L²-x²)/(24EI)，跨中挠度 w_max = 5qL⁴/(384EI)\nq, L, EI = 1.0, 1.0, 1.0\nx = linspace(0, L, 400)\nM = q * x * (L - x) / 2\nw = q * x * (L - x) * (L ** 2 - x ** 2) / (24 * EI)\nplot(x, M / (q * L ** 2), title=\"简支梁均布载荷 — 弯矩图\", xlabel=\"位置 x/L\", ylabel=\"M / (qL²)\", label=\"M(x)\")\nplot(x, w / (q * L ** 4), title=\"简支梁均布载荷 — 挠曲线\", xlabel=\"位置 x/L\", ylabel=\"w / (qL⁴)\", label=\"w(x)\")\n",
